OL,3,GNEWSALow-cost food pantry awarded #272k
OL,4,Alottery grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community hub and food pantry has
OL,7,Fbeen awarded #272,702, which managers
OL,8,Fsay will cover its main costs for the
OL,9,Fnext three years.
OL,11,FOasis Hub Bath, which opened in the
OL,12,Fcity centre in 2018, has two affordable
OL,13,Ffood pantries that support around 600
OL,14,Fpeople each week.
OL,16,FCommunity director Jo Dolby said the
OL,17,Ffunds awarded by the National Lottery
OL,18,FCommunity Fund "will cover the majority
OL,19,Fof our core operating costs over the
OL,20,Fnext three years".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
